msgid "[LLVM Announcements](https://discourse.llvm.org/c/announce/46)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:134
msgid ""
"If you just want project-wide announcements such as releases, developers "
"meetings, or blog posts, then you should check out the Announcement category "
"on LLVM Discourse."
msgstr ""

