#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:402
msgid "Guidance for office hours hosts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:404
msgid ""
"If you're interested in becoming an office hours host, please add your "
"information to the list above. Please create a calendar event for it and "
"invite calendar@llvm.org to the event so that it'll show up on the {ref}"
"`llvm-community-calendar`. Please see {ref}`llvm-community-calendar-host-"
"guidance` for more guidance on what to add to your calendar invite."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:410
msgid ""
"When starting an office hours session, if you haven't set up the Discord bot "
"integration, consider typing something like \"*Hi, I'm available for chats "
"in the next half hour at* video chat URL. *I'm looking forward to having "
"conversations on the video chat or here.*\" on the [#office-hours Discord "
"channel](https://discord.com/channels/636084430946959380/976196303681896538)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:416
msgid "Doing this can help:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:417
msgid "overcome potential anxiety to call in for a first time,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:418
msgid ""
"people who prefer to first exchange a few messages through text chat before "
"dialing in, and"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:420
msgid "remind the wider community that office hours do exist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:421
msgid ""
"If you decide to no longer host office hours, please do remove your entry "
"from the list above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:425
msgid "Discord"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:427
msgid ""
"Users and developers of the LLVM project (including subprojects such as "
"Clang) can be found on the community's [Discord](https://discord.gg/xS7Z362) "
"chat server. The server is actively moderated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:431
msgid ""
"The #buildbot-status channel has a bot for [LLVM buildbot](http://lab.llvm."
"org/buildbot/#/console) status changes. The bot will update the channel with "
"a link to a build bot when a build goes from passing to failing and again "
"when the build goes from failing back to passing. It is a great way to "
"actively monitor the status of the build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:437
msgid ""
"The bot also supports @mention-ing you when your email appears on a "
"blamelist. For more details, DM `help` to the bot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:442
msgid "Discord bot event pings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:444
msgid ""
"Our Discord bot supports automatically sending messages about upcoming "
"events on [the LLVM community calendar](https://calendar.google.com/calendar/"
"u/0/embed?src=calendar@llvm.org) to Discord. This behavior is controlled on "
"a per-event basis, by metadata in the event's description. Each piece of "
"metadata should be on its own line in the event description."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:450
msgid "The currently supported metadata is:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:452
msgid ""
"`discord-bot-event-type` - **Required**. Specifies the event type. Valid "
"values are `office-hours` and `sync-up`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:454
msgid ""
"`discord-bot-channels-to-mention` - **Sometimes required**. A comma-"
"separated list of Discord channels to post notifications in. If your "
"`discord-bot-event-type` is `office-hours`, the `#office-hours` channel will "
"be implicitly appended to this list (ergo, you don't need to specify this "
"item). Otherwise, you must specify a value here."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:459
msgid ""
"`discord-bot-mention` - **Optional**. A comma-separated list of people to "
"ping on each event notification. All names mentioned must be Discord "
"usernames, and must have a leading `@`. e.g., `@foo, @bar`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:462
msgid ""
"`discord-bot-reminder-time-before-start` - **Optional**. The number of "
"minutes before the beginning of an event to send a ping. This should be "
"formatted as an integer. Defaults to 30."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:465
msgid ""
"`discord-bot-message` - **Optional**. Text to append to all event pings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:467
msgid "An example of an event description with valid metadata is:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:480
msgid "This metadata will prompt the Discord bot to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:482
msgid ""
"send pings 5 minutes before the given event starts, mentioning `@gburgessiv` "
"and `@bar` in the ping"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:484
msgid ""
"send the pings to the `#beginners`, `#foo`, and `#office-hours` channels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:485
msgid "include the text \"Come join us for office hours!\" in the ping"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:487
msgid ""
"A few minutes before sending a ping, the bot will double-check that the "
"event hasn't been cancelled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:490
msgid ""
"If you need help troubleshooting, or have feature requests/questions, please "
"feel free to ping @gburgessiv!"
msgstr ""

