#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:563
msgid "Guidance on what to put into LLVM community calendar invites"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../GettingInvolved.md:565
msgid ""
"To add your event, create a calendar event for it and invite calendar@llvm."
"org on it. Your event should then show up on the community calendar."
